<title>ESTONIA: SOCCER-SWEDEN BEAT ESTONIA 3-2 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SWEDEN BEAT ESTONIA 3-2 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden beat Estonia 3-2 (halftime</p>
<p>1-0) in their World Cup European group four qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers</p>
<p>Sweden - Martin Dahlin 13, Par Zetterberg 53 pen, Kennet</p>
<p>Andersson 73</p>
<p>Estonia - Andres Oper 75, Marko Kristal 85</p>
<p>Attendance: 2,500</p>
<p>    Standings	 P   W   D   L   F   A   Pts</p>
<p> Scotland	     8   5   2   1   9   2   17</p>
<p> Austria		6   4   1   1   8   4   13</p>
<p> Sweden		 6   4   0   2  12   7   12</p>
<p> Latvia		 7   2   1   4   9  11    7</p>
<p> Belarus		6   1   1   4   3  10    4</p>
<p> Estonia		7   1   1   5   4  11    4</p>
<p>Next matches: Aug 20 - Estonia v Austria, Belarus v Sweden</p>
</text>
